.nh
.TH "RAIL0" "1" "Aug 2026" "rail0 CLI" ""

.SH NAME
rail0-admin-sync-errors-clear - Delete the sync errors the filters select (write mode, audited)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrail0 admin sync-errors clear [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete rows of the sync-error ledger: exactly the ones the same filters list with
\&'rail0 admin sync-errors'. The command counts them first and asks before deleting;
--yes skips the question. It cannot be undone, and the gateway audits it with its
filters and the number of rows removed.

.PP
At least one filter is required. --all empties the whole ledger instead, and that
includes the balance_divergence rows whose count 'rail0 admin health' reports: to drop a
backlog and keep those, filter by --reason.

.PP
A write: it needs write mode ('rail0 admin write-mode on').


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	Empty the whole ledger (no filter), balance_divergence rows included

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for clear

.PP
\fB--outcome\fP=""
	Only this kind of callback: confirmed or failed

.PP
\fB--payment\fP=""
	Only rows about this payment: its id (UUID) or its rail0_id (0x…)

.PP
\fB--reason\fP=""
	Only this rejection reason: not_found, external_operation, chain_mismatch, payment_mismatch, operation_mismatch, unapplicable, balance_divergence, impossible_balances

.PP
\fB--tx-hash\fP=""
	Only rows for this transaction hash

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip the confirmation prompt (required to run non-interactively)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--agent\fP[=false]
	Agent mode: one JSON envelope on stdout, JSON events on stderr, no prompts (env: RAIL0_AGENT=1)

.PP
\fB--base-url\fP=""
	RAIL0 gateway base URL (env: RAIL0_BASE_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Print HTTP request/response details to stderr

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Force plain (uncolored) JSON output (useful in scripts)

.PP
\fB--pretty\fP[=false]
	Use the key-value/table view instead of JSON (terminal only)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Print only the result's id/hash, one per line (useful in scripts)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  rail0 admin sync-errors clear --reason not_found
  rail0 admin sync-errors clear --payment 0xrail0Id… --yes
  rail0 admin sync-errors clear --all
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBrail0-admin-sync-errors(1)\fP
